		{
			dependencies: ["570E5A9796C52276"]
			description: [
				"The &6schematicannon&r is a compact solution for placing down schematics."
				""
				"To use it, place it down and give it the following things."
				"- A &bSchematic&r with a set position"
				"- Some &cgunpowder&r (One per 400 blocks)"
				"- A storage container placed next to it with the required blocks."
				""
				"After giving it everything it needs, press the &6Start [➤]&r button."
				""
				"&aIt will then start shooting blocks to place them in the correct position.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Giving the &acannon&r a &6book&r or a &6clipboard&r will write down a &dmaterial checklist&r."
				""
				"This &dchecklist&r will list out all the blocks that are needed to build the schematic but &6are not present in the connected storage&r."
				""
				"We recommend using a &6clipboard&r over a book, since it &ashows what the blocks look like&r and &ballows to manually check off items as they get supplied.&r"
				""
				"&dFeeding the same book/clipboard back in will overwrite the contents with the updated checklist.&r"
			]
