		{
			dependencies: ["4FB68561130B82C9"]
			description: [
				"&6[W] To Ponder!&r"
				""
				"&dCorporea&r and &6EMI&r have integrations with each other that can streamline pre-automation construction of your base!"
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/corporea_emi.png width:185 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Firstly you don't necessarily need to type in chat to request items. By &apinning an item to your bookmark&r &7(press [A] while hovering it)&r you can hover the bookmarked item and press c &7(by defauly)&r to request the item."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/add_bookmark_corp.png width:185 height:76 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Pressing &b[C]&r by itself requests 1 item"
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/c_request.png width:140 height:130 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Pressing &b[Shift + C]&r will request an entire stack of that item."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/c_shift_request.png width:140 height:130 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This mechanic also works with the &6recipe tree viewer&r!"
				""
				"As an example lets craft some &nfurnaces&r."
				""
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tree_crafting.png width:296 height:160 align:center}"
				""
				"By toggling the view to &6[Crafting Recipe Tree]&r the items in the tree will display as &abookmarks&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"From here you can simply &arequest items&r in the same way shown prior."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tree_crafting_bookmark.png width:197 height:33 align:center}"
				""
				"By doing things this way you can entirely cut out &cwasted time&r looking for items!"
			]
