			description: [
				"&6[W] To Ponder!&r"
				""
				"Goodness it's only Tier 0 and it's getting somewhat tricky to keep track of these production lines! &dWhat to do ‽&r"
				""
				"By sticking &ndisplay links on smart observers on the output buffers of automated setups&r you can build a &acentralized area&r showcasing the current stock of all items."
