		{
			dependencies: ["6875017F7DCC9969"]
			description: [
				"&cT&6u&eb&ae&bs&d!&r"
				""
				"Hypertubes are a &nfast and whimsical&r way to move players around the place!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The &dHypertube Entrance Block&r will allow you to enter a tube as long as it has a minimum of &b32rpm&r &7(with 256 SU)&r."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tube_stress.png width:185 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"&aTo enter a tube&r simply walk near it and hold &nshift&r. You'll be slorped right in!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Alternatively you can &nright-click&r the tube entrance with a &6wrench&r to have it automatically grab you."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tube_auto.png width:185 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"This mode will also enable &eany mob&r to enter into the tube! &7(Be careful with this)&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Tube segments themselves are limited to &n40 blocks&r. Placing a length is as simple as &bright-clicking&r one end and placing the other end when the guide line turns &agreen&r."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tube_size.png width:185 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Tube segments can be &6endlessly chained together&r, the only requirement is enough room for the bends."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tube_chain.png width:185 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Oh and in case any friends decide to trap you in &ctube hell&r, a simple &areconnect&r will kick you out of the tube."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tube_comedy.png width:185 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"&7(This also means if a tube is mid-air and you or the server crashes you will respawn mid-air and become one with the floor shortly after)&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"May your factory be full of &l&ajoy&r."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/tube_final.png width:185 height:100 align:center}"
			]
