		{
			dependencies: [
				"652CCCC43895CC57"
				"4FB68561130B82C9"
			]
			description: [
				"1 Drive can store &a10 cells&r"
				""
				"Each cell can carry &n63 unique items each&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Cells can also be given upgrades in a &dcell workbench&r."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/cell_workbench.png width:185 height:49 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &4Overflow Card&r here works much in the same way as it does in the storage bus where excess inputs &cvoid&r the items and produce &epollution&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&dFuzzy&r and &dInverter&r cards here have functionality with the &bcell-partition&r mechanic in the workbench."
				""
				"&bPartitioning&r a drive means it only stores what is listed in the internal filter as seen below."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/partition.png width:185 height:49 align:center}"
				""
				"&dFuzzy&r cards ignore durability and nbt when considering the filter."
				""
				"&dInverter&r cards allow the disk to store everything except what is listed in the filter."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"An upgrade unique to cells is the &dEqual Distribution&r card."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/equal_distribution.png width:185 height:78 align:center}"
				""
				"By default this does &cnothing&r. But! When you have &a2 or more&r in a drive something magical happens."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The items distribute! &eSomewhat&r..."
				""
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/distribute_one.png width:139 height:101 align:center}"
				"{image:compression:textures/quests/distribute_two.png width:139 height:101 align:center}"
				""
				"It's a bit &cjank&r but it works mostly well enough."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Oh and drives also have &apriority settings&r much in the same way as &bstorage buses&r do. More details in the quest directly to the &n← left ←&r."
			]
			icon: "ae2:item_cell_housing"
			id: "0BCC4B5B144C4EFA"
			rewards: [{
				id: "0821D3D493066DED"
				item: "nyagibits_bytes:tier_one_strawberry"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Every problem can be solved by more storage"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "3B266EAFB1FE7BF2"
					item: "ae2:drive"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "2D638CB27EEBBD14"
					item: "ae2:item_storage_cell_1k"
					type: "item"
